  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Courtyard Marriott Paramaribo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twin Hotels N.V. is the franchisee of the Courtyard by Marriott Paramaribo. The 138-room hotel was opened in June 2009 and is located along the Suriname River. The hotel has a business center and features meeting spaces, as well as a restaurant, fitness center, and an outdoor pool. As part of Marriott&#x2019;s regular refurbishment and upkeep program, intended to keep the property competitive and in line with brand standards, the hotel will renovate its 138 available rooms (the &#x201C;Project&#x201D;) in 2022 and 2023. The Company has estimated a total project cost of US$6,700,000 to implement and maintain the Marriott&#x2019;s brand standards. IDB Invest is proposing a senior secured loan of up to US$5 million with a 10-year tenor to support the capex investment.</narrative>
  </description>
